{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38356","headline":"和严谏议萧山庙十韵 · 吴融","name":"和严谏议萧山庙十韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"泽国瞻遗庙，云韶仰旧名。\n一隅连障影，千仞落泉声。\n老狖寻危栋，秋蛇束画楹。\n路长资税驾，岁俭绝丰盛。\n默默虽难测，昭昭本至平。\n岂知迁去客，自有复来兵。\n美舜歌徒作，欺尧犬正狞。\n近兼闻顺动，敢复怨徂征。\n日出天须霁，风休海自清。\n肺肠无处说，一爲啓聪明。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38356.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38356","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}